{"seq":3,"slug":"neural-architecture-search","title":"神经架构搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends/neural-architecture-search","wordCount":1476,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"神经架构搜索\">神经架构搜索</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>神经架构搜索（Neural Architecture Search, NAS）用算法自动设计神经网络结构，替代传统的人工设计过程。NAS 的核心问题可以分解为三个维度：搜索空间（定义什么样的架构是可能的）、搜索策略（如何在空间中寻找最优架构）和评估策略（如何高效评估候选架构的性能）。NAS 发现的架构（如 EfficientNet 的基础网络 B0、MobileNetV3）在效率和精度上都超越了同期的手工设计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;NAS 三要素&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;搜索空间&lt;br/&gt;定义可能的架构&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;搜索策略&lt;br/&gt;如何探索空间&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;评估策略&lt;br/&gt;如何衡量性能&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;强化学习&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;进化算法&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;梯度优化&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;完整训练&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; I[&quot;权重共享&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; J[&quot;性能预测&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"NAS 三要素\"] --&gt; B[\"搜索空间&lt;br/&gt;定义可能的架构\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"搜索策略&lt;br/&gt;如何探索空间\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"评估策略&lt;br/&gt;如何衡量性能\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"强化学习\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"进化算法\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"梯度优化\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"完整训练\"]\n    D --&gt; I[\"权重共享\"]\n    D --&gt; J[\"性能预测\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>NAS 方法</th>\n<th>搜索策略</th>\n<th>评估方式</th>\n<th>GPU 天数</th>\n<th>搜索空间</th>\n<th>代表成果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NASNet</td>\n<td>强化学习</td>\n<td>完整训练</td>\n<td>1800</td>\n<td>单元级</td>\n<td>NASNet 单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AmoebaNet</td>\n<td>进化算法</td>\n<td>完整训练</td>\n<td>3150</td>\n<td>单元级</td>\n<td>AmoebaNet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DARTS</td>\n<td>梯度优化</td>\n<td>权重共享</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>单元级</td>\n<td>DARTS 单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ENAS</td>\n<td>强化学习</td>\n<td>权重共享</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>单元级</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OFA</td>\n<td>训练超网</td>\n<td>子网评估</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>弹性空间</td>\n<td>Once-for-All</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"搜索空间设计\">搜索空间设计</h2><p>搜索空间定义了 NAS 可以探索的架构范围。设计良好的搜索空间既要足够大以包含高性能架构，又不能大到无法高效搜索。</p>\n<p><strong>单元级搜索空间</strong>：搜索一个计算单元（cell）的结构，然后将该单元按固定模式堆叠成完整网络。NASNet 定义了两种单元——Normal Cell（保持空间分辨率）和 Reduction Cell（降低分辨率），每个单元由一系列可选操作（3×3 卷积、5×5 卷积、最大池化、恒等映射等）组成。</p>\n<p><strong>层级搜索空间</strong>：除了搜索单元结构，还搜索网络的整体布局（每个位置使用哪种单元、通道数等）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"SEARCH_SPACE = {&#10;    &#39;operations&#39;: [&#10;        &#39;none&#39;,&#10;        &#39;skip_connect&#39;,&#10;        &#39;sep_conv_3x3&#39;,&#10;        &#39;sep_conv_5x5&#39;,&#10;        &#39;dil_conv_3x3&#39;,&#10;        &#39;dil_conv_5x5&#39;,&#10;        &#39;avg_pool_3x3&#39;,&#10;        &#39;max_pool_3x3&#39;,&#10;    ],&#10;    &#39;num_nodes&#39;: 4,&#10;    &#39;num_input_nodes&#39;: 2,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SEARCH_SPACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'operations'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'skip_connect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'sep_conv_3x3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'sep_conv_5x5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'dil_conv_3x3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'dil_conv_5x5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'avg_pool_3x3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'max_pool_3x3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'num_nodes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'num_input_nodes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>搜索空间类型</th>\n<th>搜索维度</th>\n<th>空间大小</th>\n<th>灵活性</th>\n<th>搜索效率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元级</td>\n<td>操作 + 连接</td>\n<td>~10¹⁰</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级</td>\n<td>+ 网络拓扑</td>\n<td>~10²⁰</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹性空间</td>\n<td>深度/宽度/分辨率</td>\n<td>~10⁶</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基于强化学习的搜索\">基于强化学习的搜索</h2><p>NASNet（2018）使用 RNN 控制器生成架构描述，将生成的架构训练到收敛后，以验证集精度作为奖励信号更新控制器。这种方法概念简洁但计算成本极高（1800 GPU 天）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class NASController(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, num_operations, num_nodes, hidden_dim):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.lstm = nn.LSTMCell(hidden_dim, hidden_dim)&#10;        self.op_classifier = nn.Linear(hidden_dim, num_operations)&#10;        self.node_classifier = nn.Linear(hidden_dim, num_nodes)&#10;&#10;    def sample_architecture(self):&#10;        decisions = []&#10;        h = torch.zeros(1, self.lstm.hidden_size)&#10;        c = torch.zeros(1, self.lstm.hidden_size)&#10;        for node in range(self.num_nodes):&#10;            h, c = self.lstm(h, (h, c))&#10;            op_logits = self.op_classifier(h)&#10;            op = torch.multinomial(F.softmax(op_logits, dim=-1), 1)&#10;            h, c = self.lstm(h, (h, c))&#10;            input_logits = self.node_classifier(h)&#10;            input_node = torch.multinomial(F.softmax(input_logits, dim=-1), 1)&#10;            decisions.append((op.item(), input_node.item()))&#10;        return decisions\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NASController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, num_operations, num_nodes, hidden_dim):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lstm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.LSTMCell(hidden_dim, hidden_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.op_classifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(hidden_dim, num_operations)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node_classifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(hidden_dim, num_nodes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sample_architecture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        decisions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.zeros(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lstm.hidden_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.zeros(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lstm.hidden_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.num_nodes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            h, c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lstm(h, (h, c))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            op_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.op_classifier(h)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            op </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.multinomial(F.softmax(op_logits, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            h, c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lstm(h, (h, c))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            input_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node_classifier(h)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            input_node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.multinomial(F.softmax(input_logits, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            decisions.append((op.item(), input_node.item()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decisions</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"darts-与可微搜索\">DARTS 与可微搜索</h2><p>DARTS（Differentiable Architecture Search）将离散的架构选择松弛为连续的权重参数，使得架构搜索可以通过梯度下降优化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph DARTS 超网络&#10;        X[&quot;输入&quot;] --&gt; O1[&quot;3×3 conv&lt;br/&gt;α₁&quot;]&#10;        X --&gt; O2[&quot;5×5 conv&lt;br/&gt;α₂&quot;]&#10;        X --&gt; O3[&quot;skip&lt;br/&gt;α₃&quot;]&#10;        X --&gt; O4[&quot;pool&lt;br/&gt;α₄&quot;]&#10;        O1 --&gt; MIX[&quot;加权求和&lt;br/&gt;Σ αᵢ · oᵢ(x)&quot;]&#10;        O2 --&gt; MIX&#10;        O3 --&gt; MIX&#10;        O4 --&gt; MIX&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph DARTS 超网络\n        X[\"输入\"] --&gt; O1[\"3×3 conv&lt;br/&gt;α₁\"]\n        X --&gt; O2[\"5×5 conv&lt;br/&gt;α₂\"]\n        X --&gt; O3[\"skip&lt;br/&gt;α₃\"]\n        X --&gt; O4[\"pool&lt;br/&gt;α₄\"]\n        O1 --&gt; MIX[\"加权求和&lt;br/&gt;Σ αᵢ · oᵢ(x)\"]\n        O2 --&gt; MIX\n        O3 --&gt; MIX\n        O4 --&gt; MIX\n    end</pre><p>DARTS 将每条边上的操作表示为所有候选操作的 softmax 加权和：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>o</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{o}(x) = \\sum_i \\frac{\\exp(\\alpha_i)}{\\sum_j \\exp(\\alpha_j)} o_i(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6772em;vertical-align:-0.6672em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1496em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4603em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mtight\">p</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mtight\">p</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6672em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。训练时交替优化网络权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>（在训练集上）和架构参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（在验证集上），搜索完成后取每条边上权重最大的操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class MixedOp(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, channels, operations):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.ops = nn.ModuleList([build_op(op, channels) for op in operations])&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, weights):&#10;        return sum(w * op(x) for w, op in zip(weights, self.ops))&#10;&#10;class DARTSCell(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, channels, num_nodes, operations):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.num_nodes = num_nodes&#10;        self.edges = nn.ModuleList()&#10;        self.alphas = nn.ParameterList()&#10;        for i in range(num_nodes):&#10;            for j in range(i + 2):&#10;                self.edges.append(MixedOp(channels, operations))&#10;                self.alphas.append(nn.Parameter(torch.randn(len(operations))))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MixedOp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, channels, operations):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ops </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ModuleList([build_op(op, channels) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> op </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> operations])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, weights):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> op(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w, op </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(weights, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ops))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DARTSCell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, channels, num_nodes, operations):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.num_nodes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_nodes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.edges </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ModuleList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alphas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ParameterList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_nodes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.edges.append(MixedOp(channels, operations))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alphas.append(nn.Parameter(torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(operations))))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DARTS 将搜索时间从 1800 GPU 天降低到约 1 GPU 天，但存在偏向 skip connection 等轻量操作的已知问题。后续工作（P-DARTS、Fair DARTS）通过正则化和公平约束缓解了这一问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nas-发现的架构分析\">NAS 发现的架构分析</h2><p>NAS 发现的架构与人工设计架构有一些有趣的共同点和差异：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>NAS 偏好深度可分离卷积和较小的卷积核，与人工设计的趋势一致</li>\n<li>NAS 发现的连接模式通常比人工设计更不规则</li>\n<li>在相同 FLOPs 约束下，NAS 架构通常精度更高</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"历史定位与-2025-现状说明\">历史定位与 2025 现状说明</h2><p>需要坦率说明：本篇正文记录的是 NAS 的<strong>经典方法论</strong>（2017-2019 黄金期的 NASNet/DARTS/AmoebaNet 及其加速技术），而非 2026 年的架构前沿。据公开文献的整体观察，单元级 CNN 架构搜索在 2020 年后已不再是活跃的研究主线，原因有三：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可复现性质疑</strong>：Li &amp; Talwalkar（arXiv:1902.07638, UAI 2019）指出相同算力预算下随机搜索可与多数 NAS 结果相当；权重共享超网的评估分数与子网真实精度的相关性也被多个后续工作证伪或削弱（如 Zela et al., &quot;RobustDARTS&quot;, ICLR 2020 揭示 DARTS 的崩塌现象）</li>\n<li><strong>范式转移</strong>：2020 年后架构创新的主战场转向 Transformer 与缩放定律（scaling law）——GPT/LLaMA 系的架构演进由缩放实验与少量手工改动驱动，单元级搜索无用武之地</li>\n<li><strong>成本收益失衡</strong>：数千 GPU 天的搜索成本，换来的增量常被「更大模型 + 更好训练配方」轻松覆盖</li>\n</ul>\n<p>NAS 的思想并未消失，而是以三种形态幸存：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>幸存形态</th>\n<th>代表锚点</th>\n<th>现状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬件感知搜索 + 超网</td>\n<td>Once-for-All（Cai et al., arXiv:1908.09791, ICLR 2020）</td>\n<td>端侧部署派生子网的工程手段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transformer/ViT 搜索</td>\n<td>AutoFormer（Chen et al., arXiv:2106.13000, ICCV 2021）</td>\n<td>搜索空间从卷积单元换成注意力块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>思想吸收进 AutoML 工具链</td>\n<td>超参搜索、编译器/内核配置搜索</td>\n<td>NAS 词汇融入更广的自动化系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阅读本篇的正确姿势：把 DARTS 的连续松弛、权重共享、性能预测当作<strong>自动化设计的一般方法论</strong>来学——它们在超参优化、LLM 推理配置搜索等场景仍然通用；但不要把「NAS 发现最优 CNN」当作当前的技术预期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((神经架构搜索))&#10;    搜索空间&#10;      单元级&#10;      层级&#10;      弹性空间&#10;    搜索策略&#10;      强化学习&#10;      进化算法&#10;      梯度优化 DARTS&#10;    评估加速&#10;      权重共享&#10;      性能预测&#10;      超网络&#10;    实际影响&#10;      EfficientNet B0&#10;      MobileNetV3&#10;      RegNet&#10;    历史定位&#10;      2020 后热度回落&#10;      范式转向 scaling law&#10;      思想融入 AutoML 工具链\">mindmap\n  root((神经架构搜索))\n    搜索空间\n      单元级\n      层级\n      弹性空间\n    搜索策略\n      强化学习\n      进化算法\n      梯度优化 DARTS\n    评估加速\n      权重共享\n      性能预测\n      超网络\n    实际影响\n      EfficientNet B0\n      MobileNetV3\n      RegNet\n    历史定位\n      2020 后热度回落\n      范式转向 scaling law\n      思想融入 AutoML 工具链</pre><ul>\n<li>NAS 将架构设计从人工经验驱动转变为算法自动搜索</li>\n<li>搜索空间设计是 NAS 成功的关键，过大的空间反而降低搜索效率</li>\n<li>强化学习 NAS 概念简洁但计算昂贵，需要数千 GPU 天</li>\n<li>DARTS 通过连续化松弛将搜索时间降低到 1 GPU 天</li>\n<li>权重共享和超网络是加速 NAS 评估的关键技术</li>\n<li>NAS 发现的架构在相同约束下通常优于人工设计</li>\n<li>单元级 CNN NAS 已成历史主线：其方法论（连续松弛、超网、性能预测）仍在自动化系统中复用，但架构演进的主战场已转向 Transformer 与缩放定律</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"神经架构搜索","id":"神经架构搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"搜索空间设计","id":"搜索空间设计"},{"level":2,"text":"基于强化学习的搜索","id":"基于强化学习的搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"DARTS 与可微搜索","id":"darts-与可微搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"NAS 发现的架构分析","id":"nas-发现的架构分析"},{"level":2,"text":"历史定位与 2025 现状说明","id":"历史定位与-2025-现状说明"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自监督学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends/self-supervised-learning"},"next":{"title":"高效网络设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends/efficient-networks"}}